\f1\fs22 Chip was woken by the seismic activity\'97because, of course he would be. He checked the time on his device, and immediately suspected that idiot Stoat of conducting a Washing Machine test\'97before dawn on Christmas Day, no less. He\'92d be short-staffed too.\
